WEBVTT

00:13.260 --> 00:15.620
(East Palace)

00:15.640 --> 00:16.230
Your Highness,

00:16.920 --> 00:17.960
you're finally awake.

00:18.464 --> 00:19.904
I was so afraid that you...

00:23.280 --> 00:25.030
I've returned safely, haven't I?

00:27.390 --> 00:28.550
Besides, my body

00:29.710 --> 00:31.000
is slowly getting better.

00:32.320 --> 00:33.790
But I clearly heard from our men

00:33.960 --> 00:34.750
that you almost...

00:35.320 --> 00:36.960
I just feel sorry for you,
Your Highness.

00:38.750 --> 00:41.280
Why didn't you tell
the Commandery Princess

00:41.310 --> 00:43.104
that you went
to find the cordyceps yourself?

00:47.560 --> 00:49.200
If she doesn't have feelings for me,

00:50.750 --> 00:51.750
even if she knew,

00:53.030 --> 00:55.640
she would just find another way
to repay the favor.

00:58.710 --> 01:00.110
Go tell her I'm back.

01:01.150 --> 01:02.390
I'll go see her tomorrow.

01:03.670 --> 01:04.920
But your health...

01:07.920 --> 01:08.870
I miss her.

01:23.020 --> 01:28.260
(Vibrant and Dazzling)

01:43.700 --> 01:46.660
(Vibrant and Dazzling)

02:02.480 --> 02:03.040
Your Highness,

02:03.632 --> 02:04.832
what's wrong with you?

02:11.380 --> 02:19.060
(Vibrant and Dazzling)

02:37.080 --> 02:37.630
Your Highness.

02:39.920 --> 02:40.910
What's wrong with you?

02:44.960 --> 02:46.030
I won't see her today.

04:18.300 --> 04:19.072
=Blossoms of Power=

04:19.072 --> 04:21.900
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

04:21.980 --> 04:24.940
=Episode 9=

04:34.950 --> 04:36.160
From the look on your face,

04:36.920 --> 04:37.870
is my condition

04:38.240 --> 04:39.240
extremely bad?

04:40.360 --> 04:41.680
Your Highness, the past ten years

04:42.070 --> 04:43.750
of excruciating pain you've endured

04:44.192 --> 04:45.390
have all been for nothing.

04:45.504 --> 04:47.950
You've returned to the time
when you were most deeply poisoned,

04:48.040 --> 04:49.390
living on borrowed time.

04:50.190 --> 04:51.630
This relapse is severe.

04:51.630 --> 04:53.152
The poison can no longer be controlled.

04:54.160 --> 04:56.190
I can only temporarily
release some of the poison

04:56.270 --> 04:57.160
to alleviate it.

04:57.560 --> 04:58.750
But your eyes

05:00.830 --> 05:02.510
can no longer distinguish colors.

05:10.190 --> 05:11.870
This is already
the best possible outcome.

05:14.870 --> 05:16.630
If we can't find an antidote,

05:17.000 --> 05:18.720
your six senses will gradually fade.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.160
After that,

05:21.040 --> 05:22.240
your internal organs will fail.

05:23.480 --> 05:24.630
How much time do I have left?

05:27.600 --> 05:28.510
Five years at most.

05:29.024 --> 05:30.592
If you have another acute relapse,

05:32.496 --> 05:33.870
you'll only have three years left.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.390
Tian Yuan.

05:55.160 --> 05:56.070
I was thinking,

05:56.600 --> 05:58.800
since I only have
three to five years to live,

06:00.256 --> 06:02.510
I shouldn't get involved
with Commandery Princess anymore.

06:04.190 --> 06:04.800
Your Highness,

06:05.720 --> 06:06.870
we have three to five years.

06:07.070 --> 06:08.000
The world is vast.

06:08.510 --> 06:10.040
We can definitely find an antidote.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.830
But I can't let her gamble with me.

06:16.510 --> 06:17.950
What if there's no hope?

06:18.752 --> 06:20.390
She's still in the prime of her life.

06:21.750 --> 06:23.160
She'd have to live a lonely life.

06:23.870 --> 06:25.120
How cruel would that be to her?

06:27.630 --> 06:28.270
Your Highness,

06:28.288 --> 06:30.288
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
requests an audience.

06:39.270 --> 06:39.950
I won't see her.

06:40.630 --> 06:41.190
Your Highness!

06:41.190 --> 06:42.790
From now on,
if Commandery Princess comes,

06:43.232 --> 06:45.040
I won't see her under any circumstances.

06:46.390 --> 06:46.870
Yes.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.830
Did the Crown Prince really say that?

06:50.190 --> 06:50.870
Your Highness,

06:51.160 --> 06:53.560
His Highness did say
he was already resting

06:53.560 --> 06:54.680
and wouldn't see anyone.

06:58.510 --> 07:01.190
Please, help me give this box
of cold-warding incense to His Highness.

07:01.360 --> 07:02.680
His Highness also instructed

07:02.800 --> 07:04.510
that he won't accept any gifts either.

07:04.830 --> 07:06.510
Your Highness, please go back.

07:14.680 --> 07:17.160
I always thought the Crown Prince
was so good to you.

07:17.310 --> 07:18.680
Who knew that when he turns cold,

07:18.680 --> 07:19.720
he could be so arrogant?

07:21.680 --> 07:22.240
Your Highness,

07:22.288 --> 07:23.968
let's go back to the Duke's Manor.

07:30.500 --> 07:33.860
(Contemplating the Pine Breeze)

07:33.904 --> 07:36.112
This is the medical record
of a close friend of mine.

07:36.144 --> 07:38.352
I'd like to ask you to take a look
for me, Physician Xie.

07:38.384 --> 07:39.408
Is he in good health?

07:50.310 --> 07:51.720
This person's body is weak.

07:51.968 --> 07:53.360
He has been ill for a long time.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.000
And based on the medical record,

07:56.510 --> 07:57.830
his old illness has relapsed.

07:58.120 --> 07:58.800
His eyes

07:58.976 --> 08:00.448
can no longer distinguish colors.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.600
His eyes

08:03.190 --> 08:04.360
can't see colors?

08:04.360 --> 08:05.920
This is just a superficial symptom.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.190
His lifespan...

08:09.750 --> 08:11.360
He only has three to five years left.

08:12.680 --> 08:13.480
Are you sure?

08:14.070 --> 08:15.510
If he is your dear friend,

08:16.600 --> 08:17.600
then you should

08:17.950 --> 08:19.750
show him more care and concern.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.360
Your Highness.

08:44.910 --> 08:45.910
It's so late.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.150
Why are you still awake?

08:47.536 --> 08:48.976
I was just thinking about some things.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.750
About

08:51.630 --> 08:52.750
the Crown Prince?

08:54.800 --> 08:56.840
His Highness has been recuperating
in a Taoist temple for a long time.

08:56.840 --> 08:58.672
He's long past the age
for his coming-of-age ceremony.

08:58.750 --> 08:59.750
In half a month,

08:59.750 --> 09:01.380
His Majesty will hold the ceremony
for him.

09:01.390 --> 09:03.840
The Ministry of Rites and the Court
of Imperial Clan Affairs have been busy.

09:03.910 --> 09:05.088
It's going to be a grand event.

09:05.480 --> 09:08.510
I always suspected that the person
behind the Tagara Incense,

09:08.512 --> 09:10.670
who could command Cui Jinbai
and the Embroidered Envoy

09:11.150 --> 09:12.600
might be one of the princes.

09:13.390 --> 09:16.480
But now it seems, Crown Prince is frail
and has been ill for a long time.

09:16.560 --> 09:18.400
It's impossible for him
to know martial arts.

09:18.464 --> 09:20.144
If he is truly destined
for a short life,

09:20.192 --> 09:22.224
he wouldn't be obsessed
with power struggles.

09:22.600 --> 09:23.480
He and I

09:23.480 --> 09:25.080
wouldn't become enemies

09:25.080 --> 09:26.432
due to a change in our positions.

09:26.670 --> 09:28.200
Are you saying

09:29.480 --> 09:31.240
you've decided
to marry Crown Prince?

09:32.790 --> 09:33.750
If he agrees,

09:33.840 --> 09:35.664
I will form an alliance
with the East Palace.

09:36.150 --> 09:37.390
Three to five years

09:37.390 --> 09:38.850
is enough time to lay the groundwork,

09:39.030 --> 09:40.200
appoint capable officials,

09:40.550 --> 09:41.670
ensure stability in northwest

09:42.240 --> 09:43.600
and protect the Duke of Wei's Manor.

09:43.910 --> 09:45.670
I can also secure a peaceful life
for myself.

09:47.270 --> 09:48.270
In exchange,

09:48.280 --> 09:51.184
I'll do everything in my power to help
him find the person who poisoned him.

09:51.840 --> 09:52.870
The Crown Prince and I

09:53.030 --> 09:54.440
will get along like family.

09:58.150 --> 09:59.630
Cure my eye condition?

10:00.510 --> 10:01.480
Physician Xie said

10:01.504 --> 10:03.744
that Commandery Princess
is completely devoted to you.

10:03.840 --> 10:05.712
She's frantically searching
for a prescription

10:05.712 --> 10:07.910
and a cure for your color blindness.

10:10.288 --> 10:11.630
Is what you're saying true?

10:11.910 --> 10:12.510
It's true.

10:13.584 --> 10:15.080
She sent a letter in her own hand,

10:15.080 --> 10:16.990
inviting Hua Fuhai
to discuss an important matter.

10:17.072 --> 10:17.616
Your Highness,

10:17.790 --> 10:19.790
you should go see her as Hua Fuhai.

10:19.790 --> 10:21.700
That way, you can understand
her true intentions.

10:21.710 --> 10:24.980
(I have an important matter to discuss.
Meet me at Weiyu Tower. Shen Xihe.)

10:32.240 --> 10:34.270
Greetings, Your Highness.

10:35.720 --> 10:36.720
Please have a seat, sir.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.080
Thank you, Your Highness.

10:45.536 --> 10:47.920
I'd like to ask for your help
with something, Young Master Hua.

10:48.150 --> 10:49.550
Please, just tell me what you need.

10:49.910 --> 10:51.360
You have friends all over the world.

10:51.510 --> 10:53.030
Could you help me find out

10:53.150 --> 10:55.910
where I can find the wild bees
that can cure an eye condition?

10:58.870 --> 11:02.080
I also saw the imperial notice posted
by His Majesty seeking a cure.

11:03.030 --> 11:04.270
Forgive me for asking,

11:04.640 --> 11:05.910
but are you seeking this cure

11:06.750 --> 11:08.240
for the Crown Prince of the East Palace?

11:09.360 --> 11:09.960
Yes.

11:13.720 --> 11:15.150
And how do you propose

11:15.150 --> 11:16.656
to conduct this transaction with me?

11:17.200 --> 11:18.320
I can promise you

11:18.480 --> 11:19.600
the markets of northwest.

11:22.360 --> 11:24.270
The horses, cattle,
and sheep of northwest,

11:24.270 --> 11:25.440
as well as its silk and jade,

11:25.840 --> 11:27.790
are what every merchant dreams of.

11:28.510 --> 11:30.600
Every single one is a source
of immense profit.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.390
Your Highness, could it be

11:34.030 --> 11:35.670
that you are in love
with the Crown Prince?

11:37.200 --> 11:38.510
In my heart,

11:39.390 --> 11:40.870
no one can compare to him.

11:43.510 --> 11:44.910
But the rumors say

11:45.536 --> 11:47.392
the Crown Prince is destined
for a short life.

11:49.670 --> 11:52.790
People always measure a marriage
by its length.

11:53.870 --> 11:54.910
But they don't realize

11:55.080 --> 11:57.720
that a resentful couple can spend
decades together under one roof,

11:58.160 --> 12:00.624
their hearts wearing each other down
until they become strangers,

12:01.000 --> 12:03.080
the fire in their hearts
fading like a dying lamp.

12:03.790 --> 12:05.550
If a union is true,

12:06.320 --> 12:08.368
then even if it's as brief
as the morning dew,

12:08.528 --> 12:11.952
it's better than a hundred years of
empty entanglement like a withered vine.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.480
A single night of true love

12:18.960 --> 12:20.150
is worth more than an eternity.

12:30.150 --> 12:31.550
You have been so sincere

12:31.728 --> 12:33.000
and your promise is so generous.

12:33.910 --> 12:36.240
I will certainly do everything
in my power to help.

12:53.910 --> 12:54.960
Xihe,

12:55.960 --> 12:58.840
you've been in the imperial capital
for some time now.

12:59.390 --> 13:01.480
Which prince have you chosen

13:01.480 --> 13:02.600
to be your husband?

13:03.080 --> 13:04.320
Your Majesty's princes

13:04.320 --> 13:05.600
are all exceptional men.

13:06.240 --> 13:07.320
But I

13:07.750 --> 13:09.390
only have eyes for the Crown Prince.

13:13.960 --> 13:15.200
These past few days,

13:15.840 --> 13:17.390
you haven't smiled

13:17.390 --> 13:18.840
at any of the other princes.

13:18.896 --> 13:20.784
Instead, you've been going
to the East Palace

13:20.816 --> 13:21.856
quite frequently.

13:22.630 --> 13:23.790
However,

13:24.080 --> 13:25.480
you should be aware

13:25.910 --> 13:27.750
of the Crown Prince's
frail constitution.

13:27.870 --> 13:30.270
I admire His Highness's
character and talent.

13:30.848 --> 13:33.710
A spiritual connection is more important
than spending a lifetime together.

13:33.720 --> 13:35.510
I only wish for us
to live in mutual respect,

13:35.520 --> 13:37.270
supporting each other
through thick and thin,

13:37.270 --> 13:38.816
and create a beautiful story together.

13:39.480 --> 13:40.750
Very well.

13:41.670 --> 13:42.670
However,

13:43.000 --> 13:45.320
I know what your father wants.

13:46.150 --> 13:49.440
Your father wishes for you
to marry the Ninth Prince, Prince Lie.

13:49.870 --> 13:51.600
My marriage is my own affair.

13:52.080 --> 13:54.790
The Crown Prince is also my own choice.

13:58.120 --> 14:01.390
Huayong is my most beloved son.

14:01.790 --> 14:03.200
Since you admire him,

14:03.200 --> 14:04.510
I am very pleased.

14:05.360 --> 14:06.320
I think

14:06.670 --> 14:08.960
we should wait
until his health improves a bit.

14:09.360 --> 14:10.030
Then I

14:10.550 --> 14:12.150
will ask for his opinion.

14:12.288 --> 14:13.960
We can make a final decision after that.

14:14.440 --> 14:15.720
As for your father,

14:16.000 --> 14:17.910
I will inform him beforehand.

14:18.630 --> 14:19.550
Thank you, Your Majesty.

14:29.080 --> 14:29.670
Your Highness.

14:30.080 --> 14:32.080
I have been by your side
since I was a child,

14:32.440 --> 14:34.510
and I have never seen you
so deeply troubled.

14:35.270 --> 14:36.120
Today,

14:37.216 --> 14:39.240
Commandery Princess went
to see His Majesty.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.390
She said that among all the princes,

14:45.750 --> 14:47.120
she only has feelings for me.

14:47.670 --> 14:49.270
Then what did she say

14:49.792 --> 14:51.584
when you were disguised as Hua Fuhai?

14:52.670 --> 14:53.600
She said,

14:54.432 --> 14:56.120
"Even if it's as brief
as the morning dew,

14:56.400 --> 14:59.290
it's better than a hundred years of
empty entanglement like a withered vine.

15:00.630 --> 15:01.790
A single night of true love

15:02.160 --> 15:03.670
is worth more than an eternity."

15:04.320 --> 15:04.870
Your Highness,

15:05.390 --> 15:06.000
you see,

15:06.320 --> 15:07.390
in her eyes,

15:07.910 --> 15:09.120
mutual affection

15:09.136 --> 15:11.248
is more important
than spending every day together.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.840
She may not care about
how long I have to live,

15:22.840 --> 15:24.600
but I must consider her future.

15:27.030 --> 15:27.670
Your Highness,

15:28.320 --> 15:29.360
if you truly care for her,

15:29.680 --> 15:32.000
you shouldn't be so indifferent
about life and death.

15:32.368 --> 15:34.480
Now that the other princes
are out of the running,

15:34.720 --> 15:36.320
you are her future husband.

15:36.670 --> 15:37.910
You must pull yourself together,

15:38.030 --> 15:39.150
find an antidote,

15:39.670 --> 15:41.440
and grow old with her.

15:53.660 --> 15:57.260
(Prince Xin's Manor)

16:14.000 --> 16:14.870
Changqing,

16:15.440 --> 16:16.670
I still can't get over her.

16:18.550 --> 16:20.030
I can't even bear to hear her name

16:21.510 --> 16:23.080
mentioned alongside someone else's.

16:23.510 --> 16:25.360
Even if she wants
to marry the Crown Prince,

16:26.360 --> 16:27.550
it's not for love.

16:31.104 --> 16:32.320
What do you mean, Changqing?

16:33.240 --> 16:35.320
Although Shen Xihe
often visits the East Palace,

16:36.240 --> 16:37.870
I have never seen

16:39.120 --> 16:40.630
any love for Huayong in her eyes.

16:41.750 --> 16:43.510
If a marriage isn't for love,

16:43.568 --> 16:45.000
then it must be for personal gain.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.080
Personal gain?

16:48.200 --> 16:49.790
Huayong has always been frail
and sickly.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.232
If something were to happen...

16:55.168 --> 16:57.728
Who would protect northwest for
Commandery Princess in the future?

16:57.910 --> 16:59.270
As a former Crown Princess,

16:59.630 --> 17:01.360
which new emperor would tolerate her?

17:03.960 --> 17:05.510
Don't underestimate ladies.

17:06.240 --> 17:08.110
A lady is also capable
of overturning the world.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.790
The harem has no empress.

17:10.310 --> 17:12.352
It would be perfectly reasonable
for Shen Xihe

17:12.384 --> 17:14.400
to manage the six palaces
as the Crown Princess.

17:15.000 --> 17:16.480
At that time, the entire harem

17:16.960 --> 17:18.400
would fall into her hands.

17:19.510 --> 17:20.960
Her father is the Duke of Wei.

17:21.030 --> 17:22.864
Her maternal grandfather
is the Grand Censor.

17:22.912 --> 17:25.472
She is also on good terms
with the heir of the Marquis of Shunan.

17:25.552 --> 17:27.160
Any scheme of hers

17:27.680 --> 17:29.400
is not just a fantasy.

17:32.960 --> 17:34.680
If this path succeeds,

17:34.750 --> 17:36.608
northwest will have
nothing to worry about.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.480
The Shen family

17:39.000 --> 17:40.400
will become truly unshakable.

17:47.030 --> 17:48.200
So that's it.

17:51.550 --> 17:52.750
So this is where I lost.

17:55.790 --> 17:56.750
Changying,

17:58.920 --> 18:01.310
if Shen Xihe's intentions
are truly as I suspect,

18:02.480 --> 18:04.200
then you rushing to her side recklessly

18:04.590 --> 18:06.270
is just like a moth to a flame.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.550
Greetings, Your Highness.

18:26.688 --> 18:29.200
I had you thoroughly investigate
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

18:29.680 --> 18:31.000
Did you find anything unusual?

18:31.550 --> 18:33.880
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
did indeed grow up in northwest.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.480
There is only one peculiar matter.

18:35.830 --> 18:36.400
Speak.

18:36.464 --> 18:38.550
On her journey from northwest
to the imperial capital,

18:38.608 --> 18:40.430
she was passing
through Lingxiang County by boat

18:40.440 --> 18:41.552
when she fell into the river.

18:41.560 --> 18:42.590
She nearly lost her life.

18:42.736 --> 18:44.160
The Observatory Official also said

18:44.270 --> 18:45.440
that on that day,
two moons appeared in the sky.

18:45.440 --> 18:46.608
The star gate opened wide.

18:46.640 --> 18:47.856
It was a celestial anomaly.

18:52.200 --> 18:54.000
Two moons in the sky?

18:56.270 --> 18:57.830
The star gate opened wide...

19:19.780 --> 19:22.380
(Gu Qingshu, the Gu's Second Daughter)
Brother-in-law.

19:31.310 --> 19:32.070
Brother-in-law.

19:34.720 --> 19:36.240
Didn't I tell you?

19:36.864 --> 19:38.550
Don't stay cooped up
in the manor all day.

19:39.088 --> 19:40.350
Go out for a walk more often.

19:41.720 --> 19:43.510
I've arranged for guards
around the manor.

19:43.960 --> 19:45.160
You don't have to worry at all.

19:47.000 --> 19:49.328
Three years ago, when
the Gu family fell into misfortune,

19:49.488 --> 19:51.300
you risked the crime
of deceiving the emperor,

19:51.344 --> 19:52.880
falsely claiming I had died of illness

19:52.912 --> 19:53.790
to save me.

19:54.590 --> 19:56.440
I don't want to appear before the world

19:56.830 --> 19:58.160
for fear of causing you trouble.

20:02.880 --> 20:04.000
I never intended

20:04.592 --> 20:06.592
for you to hide
for the rest of your life.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.960
This time,

20:08.000 --> 20:09.904
from among the talented men
selected by the court,

20:10.400 --> 20:11.680
I will choose a reliable young man

20:12.000 --> 20:13.590
and arrange a good marriage for you.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.590
Once you leave the imperial capital

20:15.590 --> 20:16.550
and change your name,

20:16.960 --> 20:18.350
the world is vast,

20:18.496 --> 20:19.968
and you'll have no more worries.

20:21.920 --> 20:22.480
Shu,

20:22.960 --> 20:24.160
I came today

20:24.170 --> 20:25.632
because I wanted to ask you something.

20:26.310 --> 20:27.270
Did your older sister

20:28.070 --> 20:30.960
have any connection
with Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

20:32.544 --> 20:34.000
the Duke of Wei's daughter?

20:34.384 --> 20:35.750
One was in the imperial capital,

20:36.240 --> 20:37.310
the other in northwest.

20:37.488 --> 20:39.312
How could they have known each other?

20:45.104 --> 20:47.240
It's been three years
since my sister passed away.

20:48.350 --> 20:50.640
Why are you still asking about her past?

20:51.750 --> 20:52.550
Brother-in-law,

20:54.270 --> 20:55.720
since I moved into this manor,

20:56.160 --> 20:57.550
you've only visited me three times.

20:59.160 --> 20:59.960
The first time,

21:00.192 --> 21:02.240
you asked if I had any
of my sister's belongings.

21:03.000 --> 21:03.790
The second time,

21:04.432 --> 21:06.528
you took me to pay respects
at my sister's grave.

21:06.790 --> 21:08.200
The third time is today.

21:08.960 --> 21:10.912
And again,
you're asking about my sister.

21:13.550 --> 21:15.160
My sister never loved you.

21:15.750 --> 21:16.680
But in your eyes,

21:17.750 --> 21:19.160
you still can't see anyone else.

21:21.680 --> 21:23.110
Heaven gave me

21:24.680 --> 21:26.510
too little time with your sister.

21:27.750 --> 21:29.200
If I were given another chance

21:30.240 --> 21:31.880
to start over,

21:33.270 --> 21:34.680
I would surely

21:35.640 --> 21:36.880
love her for a lifetime.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.640
I would never let her leave me again.

22:00.350 --> 22:01.200
Brother-in-law,

22:02.384 --> 22:03.760
why can't you take a good look

22:04.680 --> 22:06.480
at the people who are still alive?

22:26.880 --> 22:29.590
Xihe, you look so refreshed
and full of energy.

22:29.680 --> 22:31.520
It's like you're a completely
different person.

22:32.070 --> 22:33.830
Did you take some kind
of miracle medicine?

22:43.680 --> 22:45.680
This flirtatious scoundrel

22:46.830 --> 22:48.350
should be caught and taught a lesson.

22:52.270 --> 22:53.310
Once you're settled,

22:53.310 --> 22:54.540
I'll take you to see the stables.

22:54.550 --> 22:55.030
Okay.

22:56.240 --> 22:56.880
Du Huo.

22:58.240 --> 22:58.880
Du Huo.

22:59.070 --> 22:59.680
Du Huo.

23:02.832 --> 23:05.184
Your Highness,
it's the Commandery Princess's cat.

23:12.200 --> 23:12.750
Thank you.

23:12.944 --> 23:15.392
My cat has offended you.
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

23:16.680 --> 23:17.270
It's fine.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.240
In that case, I shall take my leave.

23:47.160 --> 23:47.880
Mo Yu,

23:48.270 --> 23:49.400
go get two sachets.

23:49.536 --> 23:51.400
One to repel insects
and one to repel snakes.

23:51.504 --> 23:53.590
Have Tian Yuan hang them
in the Crown Prince's room.

23:53.750 --> 23:55.720
The Crown Prince is so indifferent,

23:56.110 --> 23:57.440
yet you still care so much.

23:59.270 --> 24:00.400
I have already chosen him.

24:01.240 --> 24:02.030
Your Highness,

24:02.480 --> 24:04.680
I always thought most highly
of the Crown Prince before.

24:04.790 --> 24:06.160
But this time, it's confirmed.

24:06.640 --> 24:08.350
The poison in his body
is quite peculiar.

24:08.480 --> 24:10.830
Even if it's suppressed for a while,
it will recur.

24:11.160 --> 24:13.104
Moreover, he's been eroded
by the poison for years.

24:13.120 --> 24:14.920
His internal organs are extremely weak.

24:15.030 --> 24:16.336
He truly won't live a long life.

24:16.680 --> 24:18.880
Are you really going
to tell the Duke and your brother

24:18.890 --> 24:20.720
that you're going
to marry Crown Prince?

24:22.110 --> 24:23.310
This marriage

24:23.488 --> 24:24.790
has nothing to do with love.

24:26.030 --> 24:28.030
It's about choosing an ally.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.640
Someone with little time left

24:31.510 --> 24:33.030
and no ability to fight back

24:33.680 --> 24:34.830
is exactly what I need.

24:56.110 --> 24:56.640
Your Highness,

24:57.310 --> 24:59.350
what if there's some misunderstanding
in all this?

25:00.030 --> 25:01.880
Commandery Princess favors you
and you alone.

25:02.016 --> 25:03.504
She checked your medical records,

25:03.536 --> 25:05.344
and sought out physicians
and medicine for you.

25:05.510 --> 25:06.510
Her concern for you

25:06.960 --> 25:08.270
is something even I can feel.

25:09.830 --> 25:10.400
Is that so?

25:14.590 --> 25:15.920
Could it be that she chose me

25:18.800 --> 25:20.440
for any other reason than my short life?

25:22.240 --> 25:22.830
But...

25:24.110 --> 25:25.590
When you're with her,

25:25.728 --> 25:27.270
it's like you become a different person.

25:27.790 --> 25:29.110
You even laugh a lot more.

25:29.744 --> 25:31.840
You no longer seem indifferent
to life and death.

25:32.030 --> 25:34.000
You have the will to live,
to fight to stay alive.

25:34.720 --> 25:35.750
Rather than letting go,

25:36.160 --> 25:38.790
I would rather see you
become happy and bright.

25:51.750 --> 25:52.350
Your Highness!

26:03.240 --> 26:03.790
Your Highness,

26:03.824 --> 26:05.072
Commandery Princess was here.

26:05.080 --> 26:06.270
When she heard you were asleep,

26:06.510 --> 26:07.400
she left.

26:12.400 --> 26:13.550
Did she say anything else?

26:13.880 --> 26:14.750
She asked

26:15.000 --> 26:16.070
if you were ill again

26:16.790 --> 26:17.720
and if it was serious.

26:22.640 --> 26:23.350
Then...

26:23.790 --> 26:24.400
Your Highness,

26:24.640 --> 26:25.920
about your marriage to her...

26:36.920 --> 26:38.720
Seeing your complexion
improve day by day,

26:38.720 --> 26:39.440
in the future,

26:39.550 --> 26:41.248
we'll surely be able
to ride together often.

26:41.312 --> 26:42.160
In a little while,

26:42.480 --> 26:43.400
I should be able to.

26:49.310 --> 26:50.110
Young Master Bu,

26:50.720 --> 26:51.920
there's something I want.

27:00.640 --> 27:02.240
I can certainly give that a try.

27:02.880 --> 27:03.680
Xihe,

27:04.030 --> 27:05.680
wait for me to bring it back for you.

27:19.480 --> 27:21.056
Fourth Sister, what are you doing?

27:21.080 --> 27:23.720
So what? Commandery Princess Zhaoning
grew up in the northwest.

27:23.830 --> 27:26.200
Every lady from the northwest
knows how to ride.

27:26.680 --> 27:27.400
Today,

27:27.590 --> 27:28.960
let us see for ourselves.

27:45.600 --> 27:47.000
Your Highness, Commandery Princess...

27:47.000 --> 27:48.110
I don't want to hear it.

27:48.110 --> 27:49.540
Commandery Princess
fell from her horse into a ravine.

27:49.550 --> 27:51.480
Noble Consort Rong,
afraid of alarming His Majesty,

27:51.490 --> 27:52.272
has blocked the news.

27:52.288 --> 27:54.850
Young Master Bu and his guards
have been searching for a long time,

27:54.864 --> 27:55.850
but she remains missing.

27:55.920 --> 27:56.944
Take me there, quickly.

28:15.070 --> 28:15.640
Your Highness,

28:16.496 --> 28:17.952
the Commandery Princess...

28:26.608 --> 28:28.704
Xihe would never just sit
and wait for death.

28:45.110 --> 28:46.512
Tian Yuan, follow the mountain path

28:46.528 --> 28:47.950
and search at the bottom of the cliff.

28:47.960 --> 28:48.350
Okay.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.000
Your Highness,

29:29.070 --> 29:31.340
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
fell off a cliff while riding.

29:31.350 --> 29:32.070
What did you say?

29:33.480 --> 29:34.400
Take me to her, quickly!

29:34.590 --> 29:35.030
Yes.

29:35.510 --> 29:36.160
Changying!

29:39.160 --> 29:39.960
Xihe!

31:26.350 --> 31:27.110
(This scent...)

31:38.480 --> 31:39.200
Xihe!

31:49.010 --> 31:54.720
♪Let it all go,
give my tears to the flowers♪

31:56.160 --> 32:02.060
♪Beneath my feet,
eternal doom is more than wind and sand♪

32:03.140 --> 32:08.730
♪That perfectly plotted love hides
in the clamor♪

32:10.180 --> 32:15.680
♪Between us,
it's both treacherous and flawless♪

32:17.060 --> 32:22.590
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

32:22.990 --> 32:30.740
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

32:30.990 --> 32:34.370
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

32:34.570 --> 32:37.930
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

32:38.130 --> 32:41.470
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

32:41.470 --> 32:45.060
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless waters♪

32:45.060 --> 32:48.330
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

32:48.470 --> 32:52.020
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

32:52.020 --> 32:55.590
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

32:55.590 --> 33:02.040
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

33:02.460 --> 33:05.850
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

33:05.850 --> 33:09.510
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

33:09.510 --> 33:12.940
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

33:12.940 --> 33:16.480
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

33:16.480 --> 33:19.730
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

33:19.940 --> 33:23.410
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

33:23.410 --> 33:26.950
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

33:26.950 --> 33:30.110
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

33:35.600 --> 33:37.690
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

33:37.930 --> 33:40.930
♪Become the tears
in the corner of my eyes♪

33:41.480 --> 33:43.770
♪And blossom into a flower♪

34:03.392 --> 34:04.480
The fever's finally gone.

34:09.510 --> 34:10.670
You saved me.

34:22.710 --> 34:23.710
It was a coincidence.

34:27.472 --> 34:29.776
Thank you for saving my life today,
Your Highness.

34:30.550 --> 34:31.880
I will remember this.

34:32.440 --> 34:33.440
In the future,

34:33.510 --> 34:35.230
if I have the chance
to give my life for you,

34:36.150 --> 34:37.960
I will not hesitate for a moment.

34:43.568 --> 34:45.120
You don't need to give your life.

34:46.400 --> 34:47.800
If you truly wish to repay me,

34:48.000 --> 34:49.630
how about you answer a question
for me now?

34:51.280 --> 34:52.230
What question?

34:53.280 --> 34:54.550
I wonder if you would be

34:55.872 --> 34:57.008
willing to marry me.

35:03.360 --> 35:04.760
All the princes

35:04.920 --> 35:05.960
have their own merits.

35:06.230 --> 35:07.400
They are all vying for my hand.

35:07.920 --> 35:10.280
What gives you the advantage,
Your Highness?

35:18.110 --> 35:19.360
I have no particular strengths.

35:20.760 --> 35:21.960
Fortunately, I am frail.

35:23.230 --> 35:24.360
When I become emperor,

35:25.360 --> 35:26.630
if you find me to be in your way,

35:27.670 --> 35:28.590
I can die early.

35:39.320 --> 35:40.030
Your Highness,

35:41.800 --> 35:43.110
I do not love you.

35:44.448 --> 35:45.880
But I want to join forces with you

35:46.320 --> 35:47.190
to form an alliance.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.670
You are quite frank.

35:55.670 --> 35:56.760
If you are willing,

35:57.110 --> 35:58.150
we shall marry.

35:59.150 --> 36:01.000
From now on, we will rely on each other

36:01.280 --> 36:02.360
and face all storms together.

36:03.510 --> 36:04.510
If you do not betray me,

36:04.510 --> 36:05.510
I will never leave you.

36:06.176 --> 36:08.288
But I don't want
to just join forces with you.

36:09.400 --> 36:10.670
I want to join hands with you.

36:11.040 --> 36:13.328
But I can only offer
a mutually beneficial relationship.

36:17.280 --> 36:18.630
I'm very easy to please.

36:19.670 --> 36:20.800
Even if it's a lie,

36:21.440 --> 36:22.550
I'm willing to believe it.

36:25.760 --> 36:26.920
A Crown Prince with no faction

36:27.320 --> 36:29.110
and no power

36:29.760 --> 36:31.190
can, without distraction,

36:31.190 --> 36:32.480
help me protect northwest.

36:33.000 --> 36:33.630
Of course,

36:34.000 --> 36:35.190
I will also help you

36:35.280 --> 36:36.928
find the person who poisoned you.

36:37.480 --> 36:39.550
What do you think, Your Highness?

36:48.230 --> 36:48.840
Alright.

36:49.984 --> 36:51.760
I agree to form an alliance with you.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.710
But you must promise me something.

36:55.150 --> 36:56.360
If one day,

36:58.800 --> 37:00.150
you fall in love with me,

37:01.960 --> 37:03.360
you must tell me right away.

37:05.880 --> 37:06.400
Okay.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.510
Xihe!

37:20.800 --> 37:21.590
Xihe!

37:21.920 --> 37:24.070
Commandery Princess!

37:24.070 --> 37:25.510
You few, go that way.

37:25.510 --> 37:26.064
- Yes!
- Yes!

37:26.510 --> 37:27.400
Commandery Princess!

37:27.400 --> 37:28.070
Xihe!

37:28.070 --> 37:29.070
Commandery Princess!

37:29.584 --> 37:31.510
- Commandery Princess!
- Commandery Princess!

37:31.510 --> 37:32.070
Xihe!

37:32.070 --> 37:33.104
Commandery Princess!

37:34.590 --> 37:35.440
Where are you?

37:35.440 --> 37:36.630
- Commandery Princess!
- Commandery Princess!

37:36.630 --> 37:37.230
Go that way!

37:38.440 --> 37:39.630
- Commandery Princess!
- Xihe!

37:39.630 --> 37:40.280
Changying!

37:40.360 --> 37:41.320
Commandery Princess!

37:41.960 --> 37:42.550
Changying!

37:42.800 --> 37:43.710
Commandery Princess!

37:45.150 --> 37:46.360
Xihe!

37:46.360 --> 37:47.760
- Commandery Princess!
- Changying!

37:47.792 --> 37:48.800
Can you hear me?

37:48.810 --> 37:50.180
- Changying!
- Commandery Princess!

37:50.192 --> 37:51.680
You've been running around all night.

37:52.230 --> 37:53.230
Don't make Mother worry.

37:53.590 --> 37:54.280
Come back with me.

37:55.056 --> 37:56.760
- I'm not going back.
- Commandery Princess!

37:56.800 --> 37:57.710
I have to find her.

37:57.800 --> 37:59.420
- Changying,
- Commandery Princess!

37:59.440 --> 38:00.550
a storm is coming.

38:00.550 --> 38:01.320
It's getting late.

38:01.440 --> 38:02.480
It's easy to get lost.

38:02.480 --> 38:03.792
We haven't looked over there yet.

38:04.112 --> 38:04.704
Follow me!

38:04.710 --> 38:05.190
- Yes.
- Yes.

38:05.190 --> 38:05.710
Changying!

38:07.110 --> 38:07.630
That's enough.

38:07.776 --> 38:09.376
Come back to the temporary palace
with me.

38:09.380 --> 38:11.250
Or I'll have my men tie you up
and take you back.

38:11.260 --> 38:11.728
Move!

38:11.760 --> 38:13.104
- No!
- Commandery Princess!

38:14.000 --> 38:14.670
Move!

38:15.960 --> 38:16.760
Xihe!

38:16.960 --> 38:17.710
Changying!

38:17.800 --> 38:18.590
Commandery Princess!

38:19.320 --> 38:19.960
Are you crazy?

38:19.960 --> 38:20.880
Xihe!

38:50.710 --> 38:53.400
- Commandery Princess!
- Commandery Princess!

38:53.400 --> 38:54.912
- Xihe.
- Commandery Princess!

38:55.670 --> 38:57.060
- Xihe.
- Commandery Princess!

38:58.590 --> 38:59.760
Commandery Princess!

38:59.760 --> 39:00.800
Shen Xihe!

39:00.880 --> 39:02.304
- Changying.
- Commandery Princess!

39:03.030 --> 39:03.670
Xihe.

39:03.670 --> 39:05.280
Commandery Princess!

39:05.800 --> 39:06.360
Shen Xihe.

39:06.360 --> 39:07.030
Changying!

39:08.360 --> 39:09.760
Can you please listen to me?

39:09.856 --> 39:11.360
Go back to the palace and wait for news.

39:11.456 --> 39:12.784
I'll look for her for you.

39:12.816 --> 39:13.856
Commandery Princess!

39:14.440 --> 39:15.110
Rest assured.

39:16.000 --> 39:17.320
I've already dispatched all my men.

39:17.376 --> 39:19.120
- We must find her.
- Commandery Princess!

39:21.600 --> 39:22.490
Commandery Princess!

39:22.710 --> 39:23.840
I'll look for her myself.

39:25.480 --> 39:26.480
Xihe.

39:26.480 --> 39:27.280
Commandery Princess!

39:27.280 --> 39:28.190
Xihe!

39:35.280 --> 39:36.550
Xihe!

39:39.800 --> 39:40.550
Xihe.

39:41.880 --> 39:42.760
Are you all right?

39:43.400 --> 39:44.550
Are you hurt anywhere?

39:45.744 --> 39:47.550
Thank you for your concern,
Your Highness.

39:48.230 --> 39:49.440
I am fine.

39:49.920 --> 39:51.150
It was just a scare.

39:51.800 --> 39:52.760
I'm glad you're okay.

39:53.360 --> 39:55.510
Your Highness, why are you here?

39:56.590 --> 39:57.590
I ate too much last night,

39:57.840 --> 39:58.800
so I went out for a walk.

39:58.880 --> 40:00.128
I accidentally fell off a cliff.

40:00.496 --> 40:02.240
Thankfully,
Commandery Princess saved me.

40:02.710 --> 40:03.710
We were lost,

40:03.920 --> 40:04.960
but luckily, she

40:04.960 --> 40:06.760
knew of a small path
through the mountain.

40:06.840 --> 40:07.710
That's how we escaped.

40:08.688 --> 40:10.240
We can talk about the details later.

40:10.320 --> 40:12.080
Let's escort her back
to the palace first.

40:14.190 --> 40:14.880
Guards.

40:14.928 --> 40:17.110
Escort Crown Prince and
Commandery Princess back to the palace.

40:17.120 --> 40:17.808
- Yes.
- Yes.

40:18.320 --> 40:21.070
(Qingzhi often gathers herbs
around here.)

40:22.440 --> 40:25.000
(The path she knows
is extremely hidden.)

40:30.920 --> 40:33.360
(Shen Xihe grew up in northwest.)

40:33.480 --> 40:35.616
(And this is her first time
at the hunting grounds.)

40:35.960 --> 40:37.440
(How could she know this path?)

40:45.376 --> 40:47.136
I've met Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

40:47.280 --> 40:48.320
She was the one who guessed

40:48.760 --> 40:50.510
that you were behind all of this.

40:53.230 --> 40:54.800
(I've never met her before.)

40:54.880 --> 40:57.320
(How does she know my thoughts so well?)

40:57.616 --> 40:59.710
On her way from northwest
to the imperial capital,

40:59.840 --> 41:00.840
she fell into the river.

41:00.840 --> 41:02.480
On that day,
two moons appeared in the sky,

41:02.528 --> 41:03.350
the star gate opened,

41:03.360 --> 41:04.640
and there was a celestial anomaly.

41:05.920 --> 41:06.590
Changqing,

41:07.264 --> 41:08.304
what's wrong with you?

41:09.360 --> 41:10.070
Changqing!

41:10.840 --> 41:11.400
Changqing!

41:13.400 --> 41:14.030
What's wrong?

41:14.448 --> 41:15.440
What's wrong, Changqing?

41:17.760 --> 41:18.630
Who are you?

41:22.920 --> 41:23.590
Changqing.

41:38.030 --> 41:39.110
Do you recognize

41:40.840 --> 41:41.840
what this is?

42:00.500 --> 42:02.980
(Vibrant and Dazzling)

42:10.432 --> 42:12.240
Even if the person hidden deep
in your heart

42:12.270 --> 42:13.232
changes their appearance,

42:13.232 --> 42:14.670
they will eventually be recognized.

42:14.704 --> 42:16.784
Do you really think
Commandery Princess is your wife?

42:16.816 --> 42:17.488
What?

42:17.670 --> 42:18.670
Are you trying to stop me?

42:19.710 --> 42:20.760
Have you gone mad?

42:20.840 --> 42:22.590
Changqing, you truly are audacious.

42:22.688 --> 42:23.840
You want to get rid of me?

42:24.070 --> 42:25.320
I just want you to stop

42:25.456 --> 42:27.150
bothering
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

42:33.031 --> 42:35.971
♪I've hidden so many words♪

42:36.591 --> 42:39.391
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

42:40.261 --> 42:47.231
♪So never uncover♪

42:47.421 --> 42:49.781
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

42:50.911 --> 42:53.641
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

42:54.601 --> 42:59.941
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

43:01.701 --> 43:04.521
♪Every answer I gave♪

43:05.321 --> 43:08.171
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

43:08.961 --> 43:12.331
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

43:12.591 --> 43:15.901
♪How hard it truly was?♪

43:18.871 --> 43:22.311
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

43:23.301 --> 43:25.631
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

43:26.901 --> 43:32.661
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

43:34.071 --> 43:37.201
♪It's a shame I never could♪

43:37.651 --> 43:40.661
♪Give you a moon in return♪

43:40.771 --> 43:47.411
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

43:47.411 --> 43:51.081
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

43:51.951 --> 43:54.711
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

43:55.151 --> 43:58.281
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

43:58.721 --> 44:04.671
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

44:06.071 --> 44:09.621
♪You'll never♪

44:09.901 --> 44:19.371
